      "message": "Rather than duplicating this function, I\u0027d recommend creating a single function that takes a timeout. The above function would call this function with a timeout of 0, which would mean no timeout. In fact, the dump_backtrace_to_file_timeout function already works this way, so you wouldn\u0027t even need to do anything other than pass the value to that function.\n\nIt would like so:\n\nstatic void android_os_Debug_dumpNativeBacktraceToFile(JNIEnv* env, jobject clazz,\n    jint pid, jstring fileName)\n{\n    android_os_Debug_dumpNativeBacktraceToFileTimeout(en, clazz, pid, fileName, 0);\n}\n\nThen the second function would be as you have written here.",
